  (text "KSZ9563R integrated PHY ports connect SERVER and LAN/WAN RJ45 MagJacks.\\nDefault isolated: reset low or policy fault disables forwarding between SERVER and LAN/WAN.\\nrelease_temporary changes bridge/VLAN/port-forwarding state only for a bounded TTL." (at 20.32 22.86 0)
